Plague is among the best weapon artifacts in Slash'em, and happens to be 
a chaotic droven bow. Perfect for the ranger. Confers poison resistance 
and auto-poisons arrows fired from it. Remember that bows in Slash'em 
requires both hands and so you can't use a shield at the same time.

Otherwise, you want the standard selection of resistances:
MR
Reflection
Drain (Very Important against /oDraining)
Flying or Swimming to avoid those nasty spellcasters creating water 
under your feet and drowning you.

One set that will give you all that is:
Cloak of MR
SDSM
"oDrainRes
Gauntlets of Swimming

